  "notes": "Astral Foods Limited (JSE: ARL) \u2014 South Africa's largest integrated poultry producer. Two divisions: Poultry (County Fair, Festive, Goldi brands \u2014 broiler grow-out, processing) and Feed (Meadow Feeds, the country's largest animal-feed business, sells externally and intercompany). Fiscal year ends 30 September. Dual challenge over FY22-FY24: (1) load-shedding (electricity rationing) which forced diesel generator running; (2) avian-influenza (HPAI) outbreaks in mid-2023 destroyed ~2M breeder hens, requiring R220M government grant + multi-year flock rebuild; (3) high feed-grain prices (yellow maize, soy meal). FY24 was a recovery year as power supply normalized and feed costs eased. Annual report at astralfoods.com/investors/.",
